OL,3,GNEWSABombed WW2 cinema to reopen after
OL,4,A85 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe remains of a cinema bombed during
OL,7,FWorld War Two is to reopen as a
OL,8,Fmemorial garden and history centre
OL,9,Ffollowing a restoration project.
OL,11,FThe National Picture Theatre, in Hull,
OL,12,Fwas hit during a German air raid on 17
OL,13,FMarch 1941 and left derelict.
OL,15,FHull City Council has described the
OL,16,Fsite, in Beverley Road, as the "last
OL,17,Fsurviving civilian, bombb@Qdamaged
OL,18,Fbuilding in the UK".
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
