OL,3,GNEWSABombed WW2 cinema to reopen after
OL,4,A85 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe facade has now been restored and
OL,7,Fthe open space where the auditorium
OL,8,Fonce stood will become an education and
OL,9,Fcommunity events area, as well as a
OL,10,F"place of reflection", according to the
OL,11,Fcouncil. It will open on 16 September.
